{"path":"numeric/bit_floor","title":"std::bit_floor","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>bit_floor","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/bit_floor","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"If x is not zero, calculates the largest integral power of two that is not greater than x. If x is zero, returns zero.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/bit\">&lt;bit&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T bit_floor<span class=\"br0\">(</span> T x <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> is not zero, calculates the largest integral power of two that is not greater than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code>. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> is zero, returns zero.\n</p><p>This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code>T</code> is an unsigned integer type (that is, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">short</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span>, or an extended unsigned integer type).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> x\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> unsigned integer value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Zero if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> is zero; otherwise, the largest integral power of two that is not greater than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><small>Prior to <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P1956R1\" data-external=\"1\">P1956R1</a>, the proposed name for this function template was <code>floor2</code>.</small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_int_pow2\"><code>__cpp_lib_int_pow2</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/20#cpp_lib_int_pow2_202002L\"><code>202002L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++20)</span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric#Bit_manipulation_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29\">Integral power-of-2 operations</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/unsigned_integral\"><span class=\"kw2957\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unsigned_integral</span></span></a> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    requires <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>\n             <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, char8_t<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, <span class=\"kw4\">char16_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>\n             <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, <span class=\"kw4\">char32_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2950\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T bit_floor<span class=\"br0\">(</span>T x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>x <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> T<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/bit_width\"><span class=\"kw2715\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bit_width</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bit&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> bin <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> x<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> x <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu8\">012</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"bit_floor( \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bin<span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ) = \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bin<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">bit_floor</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>bit_floor( 00000000 ) = 00000000\nbit_floor( 00000001 ) = 00000001\nbit_floor( 00000010 ) = 00000010\nbit_floor( 00000011 ) = 00000010\nbit_floor( 00000100 ) = 00000100\nbit_floor( 00000101 ) = 00000100\nbit_floor( 00000110 ) = 00000100\nbit_floor( 00000111 ) = 00000100\nbit_floor( 00001000 ) = 00001000\nbit_floor( 00001001 ) = 00001000</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/bit_ceil\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>bit_ceil</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the smallest integral power of <span class=\"texhtml\">2</span> not less than the given value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/rotr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rotr</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the result of bitwise right-rotation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/bit_width\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>bit_width</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the smallest number of bits needed to represent the given value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/has_single_bit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>has_single_bit</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a number is an integral power of <span class=\"texhtml\">2</span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::bit_floor","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. If x is not zero, calculates the largest integral power of two that is not greater than x."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"x"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Zero if x is zero; otherwise, the largest integral power of two that is not greater than x."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Prior to P1956R1, the proposed name for this function template was floor2."},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"bit_ceil","note":"finds the smallest integral power of 2 not less than the given value"},{"label":"rotr","note":"computes the result of bitwise right-rotation"},{"label":"bit_width","note":"finds the smallest number of bits needed to represent the given value"},{"label":"has_single_bit","note":"checks if a number is an integral power of 2"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":307,"codeBlockCount":3}
